+- [x] do-not-capture list: environment failures, negative tool claims, transient errors, one-off
+  narratives, unresolved failures (golden)
+- [x] summary from the fork's own tool results only; staged and rolled-back writes omitted; modes
+  off/on/verbose (test: `test_summary.py::test_staged_failed_and_duplicate_writes_are_not_reported`,
+  `::test_add_and_patch_in_on_mode_are_two_generic_lines`, `::test_verbose_adds_a_short_preview`,
+  `::test_off_mode_has_no_lines_and_no_event`)
+- [x] completion log line with usage (test: `::test_completion_log_line`)
+- Deliberate differences: our wording throughout; "on" lines are generic per store/skill; previews
+  are one limit (200) instead of per-op limits; no emoji glyphs.
+- Not taken: the consolidation "proposal staged" line (curator proposals are P09-19's).
+
+## Status
+
+Done (2026-10-19). Shared: `protocol/events.py` (`LearningReviewDone`) + regenerated
+`packages/protocol/src/generated/*` + `tests/unit/protocol/_samples.py`;
+`foundation/config/schema.py` (`display.learning_notices`). The golden test lives in
+`tests/golden/learning/test_review_prompts.py` (so `--update-golden` applies).
